"reporting-provincial-achievement-test-results-to-parents-in-june-pilot-evaluation-2005-2006-1120", "notes": "This report evaluates a 2005-2006 pilot project by Alberta Education to provide preliminary Provincial Achievement Test (PAT) results for grades six and nine to parents and students in June. It examines the perceptions of parents, teachers, and principals regarding the timeliness, value, and challenges associated with this early reporting. The study analyzes survey data on satisfaction levels, communication effectiveness, and recommendations for expanding the initiative province-wide. The findings inform future policy decisions on student assessment and communication strategies between schools and parents.", "num_resources": 1, "num_tags": 8, "organization": {"id": "079da4a3-1719-4361-9168-219985d29cf3", "name": "education", "title": "Education", "type": "organization", "description": "", "image_url": "", "created": "2015-05-13T08:55:38.599044", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "079da4a3-1719-4361-9168-219985d29cf3", "private": false, "pubtype": ["Report"], "sensitivity": "unrestricted", "state": "active", "title": "Reporting provincial achievement test results to parents in June pilot evaluation 2005-2006", "topic": ["Education - Early Childhood to Grade 12"], "type": "publications", "updatefrequency": "Once", "url": null, "usageconsiderations": "Digital reproduction of a Government of Alberta print publication.", "version": null, "resources": [{"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2026-07-27T17:23:22.465957", "datastore_active": false, "description": "", "format": "PDF", "hash": "", "id": "387a3916-4c63-444d-90a5-6041ae99a213", "last_modified": "2026-07-27T17:23:22.373783", "metadata_modified": "2026-07-27T17:23:22.970868", "mimetype": "application/pdf", "mimetype_inner": null, "name": "Reporting provincial achievement test results to parents in June pilot evaluation 2005-2006", 